{"id":"n48327-1-19","stage":4,"title":"두루 · 大体都","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48327-1-19-1","ko":"두루 평안하시지요?","zh":"大家都过得平安吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"두루","meaning":"大体都，大致都，广泛地，一一","explanation":"두루：大体都，大致都，广泛地，一一","readings":[{"term":"두루","audio":"/audio/ec41141df20bcf031713.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48327","senseId":"1","lemma":"두루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평안하시지요?","meaning":"安康，平安","explanation":"평안하다：安康，平安；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"평안하다","audio":"/audio/078e8e9393aff5aead56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81279","senseId":"1","lemma":"평안하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec41141df20bcf03","term":"두루","zh":"大体都，大致都，广泛地，一一","audio":"/audio/ec41141df20bcf031713.mp3","entryId":"48327","definition":"不偏重于某一方面，一个都不漏地多方面均衡地。","pronunciation":["두루"]},{"id":"078e8e9393aff5ae","term":"평안하다","zh":"安康，平安","audio":"/audio/078e8e9393aff5aead56.mp3","entryId":"81279","definition":"无忧无患；或过得很安稳。","pronunciation":["평안하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/149c4375c99ef5df69c3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48327-1-19-2","ko":"네, 덕분에 잘 지내고 있습니다.","zh":"是的，多亏了大家，我过得很好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내고